---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/index.css';
import '../styles/about.css';
---

<Layout
	title="KingTech | About Us"
	description="Learn more about KingTech."
>
	<div class="page-shell">
		<main>
			<section class="intro-block about-intro-card">
				<div>
					<p class="section-label">About KingTech</p>
					<h1>Driven by curiosity, built through hands-on technology.</h1>
				</div>
				<p class="about-intro-lead">
					KingTech is a Dutch company founded in 2012 by Gijs van der Meijde. Since then,
					KingTech has explored a wide range of technical fields, always aiming to stay at the
					cutting edge. From 3D printing and industrial electronics to software and custom PCs,
					KingTech has worked across it all.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="intro-block about-story-card">
				<div>
					<p>
						Like many tech enthusiasts, founder Gijs van der Meijde was often asked to configure,
						build, and repair computers for friends and family. It did not take long before he
						started taking paid jobs in his local area. Although this work was not yet under the
						KingTech name, this is where our roots began.
					</p>
					<p>
						Driven by a passion for the latest gadgets, Gijs was constantly experimenting with new
						technologies such as drones, 3D printers, and home automation. It came as no surprise
						that he chose to study embedded software design and computer science.
					</p>
					<p>
						With a background in embedded systems and computer science, Gijs van der Meijde began
						taking on development projects for a wide range of companies. That is how the KingTech
						label officially started.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="about-story-image">
					<img src="/gijs-bit.jpg" alt="Gijs van der Meijde" />
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="about-office-card">
				<p>
					Moving into a new office in 2020 opened up even more possibilities. The new KingTech office
					and server infrastructure allow us to develop software more efficiently, while our workshop,
					featuring professional soldering equipment, 3D printers, and more, helps us take on larger
					and more complex projects than ever before.
				</p>

				<div class="about-office-grid">
					<figure>
						<img src="/office/office-solderingtable.jpg" alt="Electronics corner with soldering setup" />
						<figcaption>Our fine electronics corner featuring professional soldering equipment</figcaption>
					</figure>
					<figure>
						<img src="/office/office-workshop.jpg" alt="KingTech workshop space" />
						<figcaption>Our workshop</figcaption>
					</figure>
					<figure>
						<img src="/office/office-office.jpg" alt="KingTech ergonomic workspace" />
						<figcaption>Our ergonomic workspace</figcaption>
					</figure>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
	</div>
</Layout>
